    "body": "It was trying to load the module state from the imported module rather than our own. This was doomed to failure because either there would be no module state or the wrong module state.\n\nI've confirmed that the `import_star` test runs with module state (where it crashed before). I haven't done it here but perhaps it's the right time to star running a subset of known working tests with module state.",
