                "message": "Fix import_star with module state\n\nIt was trying to load the module state from the imported module\nrather than our own. This was doomed to failure because either\nthere would be no module state or the wrong module state.\n\nI've confirmed that the `import_star` test runs with module state\n(where it crashed before). I haven't done it here but perhaps it's\nthe right time to star running a subset of known working tests with\nmodule state.",
